s ( 8.6 )] 5 mg twice daily 10 mg 1 Elderly patients may be more sensitive to the therapeutic or adverse effects of metoclopramide; therefore, consider a lower dosage of 5 mg four times daily with titration to the recommended adult dosage of 10 mg four times daily based upon response and tolerability."
