    "dosage_and_administration": "Deep anesthesia as in cataract extraction: Instill 1 drop every 5 to 10 minutes for 5 to 7 doses. Removal of sutures: Instill 1 or 2 drops 2 or 3 minutes before removal of stitches. Removal of foreign bodies: Instill 1 or 2 drops prior to operating. Tonometry: Instill 1 or 2 drops immediately before measurement. FOR TOPICAL OPHTHALMIC USE ONLY"
