ent, urinary retention; Metabolism and nutrition disorders : decreased appetite, hyperkalemia; Skin and subcutaneous tissue disorders : exfoliative dermatitis, erythema multiforme, dry skin; Eye disorders : glaucoma; Gastrointestinal disorders : gastroesophageal reflux disease, ileus, vomiting, abdominal pain, dysgeusia, sialadenitis; Respiratory, thoracic and mediastinal disorders : dysphonia, nasal dryness; Musculoskeletal and connective tissue disorders : muscular weakness.",
