onitoring [see Warnings and Precautions ( 5.2 )]. 2.3 Dosage Modifications for Drug Interactions Dosage modification may be needed when NOVOLOG MIX 70/30 is used concomitantly with certain drugs [see Drug Interactions (7)] ."
